        <item>Battle Rats can\'t go on Expeditions while designated.</item>
        <item>The Boiler Baron waits somewhere past Level 30…</item>
        <item>Long-press most tiles for a quick explainer.</item>
        <item>Splicing two rats at the Fusion Pot mints one new one.</item>
