    <!--
      What's New, shown once after an update.

      This list is the whole of what that dialog says, so a release is written up
      by editing it and nothing else - the rule that decides when to show it does
      not read the text and does not care how many lines are in it. Rewrite it
      per release; the bullets are literal characters and the breaks are \n.
    -->
    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s New</string>
    <string name="whats_new_body">• Boss fights now have named moves and their own faction wheel\n• The egg hatches through an animated pipe-maze tunnel\n• Rats can be assigned to Scrap Runs and Ledger Tasks for a faction bonus\n• New portrait art for over 30 rats\n• Riveted Copper and Aether Coil frames added to the Binder\n• Leveling and hatching pacing rebalanced\n• The Ledger board rerolls at your own midnight, not UTC\n• Fixed a boss fight that could vanish with no way back</string>
    <string name="btn_got_it">Got it</string>

